  "body": "Welcome to 58 Seafarer Crescent, Stanmore Bay, a stylish, low-maintenance duplex designed for easy family living and effortless entertaining.\r\n\r\nSet over two spacious levels, this beautifully presented home offers 3 generous bedrooms and multiple bathrooms, including a master retreat with walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite. Downstairs, the modern open-plan kitchen, dining and lounge create a warm social hub where everyone naturally comes together.\r\n\r\nSlide open the doors and discover your own private outdoor haven. The fully fenced backyard features a sunny deck, separate paved entertaining area, low maintenance gardens and secure gated side access, perfect for kids and safe for pets.\r\n\r\nPracticality is covered too, with internal access garaging, laundry, extra storage (including a small workshop space), a garden shed and additional off-street parking.\r\n\r\nPositioned in a peaceful, family-friendly street, it is just minutes from local amenities, beautiful beaches, quality schools, shops, cafés, and more.\r\nThis is an outstanding opportunity for first-home buyers, growing families or savvy investors looking for modern coastal convenience.\r\n\r\nYour next chapter starts here… \r\n\r\nKeywords List:\r\nStanmore Bay, Whangaparaoa, Red Beach, Manly, Silverdale, Arkles Bay, Stanmore Bay, Big Manly Beach, Whangaparaoa Plaza, Coast Plaza, Hoyts Silverdale, Pool & Leisure Centre, Stanmore Bay School, Whangaparaoa College, New World, Little Manly Café\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
